> "The berzosertib trial (NCT02595892) initially failed CrisPRO's 0.10 delta threshold using a 7D vector (delta=0.064). Analysis of the failure identified a missing RS-score axis. After building and integrating the RSS axis (PMID 34552099), the trial passed with delta=0.138. This is documented feature engineering driven by retroactive validation failure — not post-hoc tuning."

